        },
        "style": {},
        "advanced": {},
        "children": []
       },
       {
        "id": "vp-body-1",
        "type": "text-block",
        "settings": {
         "content": "<p>We started by throwing out the clichés. Instead of selling panels, Helio would sell the feeling of independence — your own power, your own terms. That single idea reshaped the name, the identity and the entire launch.</p><p>The result is a warm, confident system built around a single graphic device — the rising mark — that works as a logo, a loading state, a billboard and everything in between.</p>",
         "text_color": "#9b988f",
         "font_size": "18",
         "line_height": "1.7",
         "text_align": "left",
         "max_width": "720"
        },
        "style": {},
        "advanced": {},
        "children": []
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   },
